Entity Printer {
    Actions: start, print
    Data properties: ready: boolean, jobs: a list
    States: online, idle, jammed
}

Role Operator.

Action start { Initiators: Operator }
Action print { Initiators: Operator }

// 1. contradicts itself: a list cannot be empty and full at once
Declarative specification Printer is jammed means {
    the jobs is empty
    AND the jobs is full
}

Declarative specification Printer is idle means {
    it is online
    AND the jobs is empty
}

Declarative specification Printer is online means {
    the ready equal to true
}

// 2. the Given contradicts 'Printer is idle': an idle printer's jobs is empty
Scenario: Idle printer
Given the Printer is idle AND "report.pdf" is included in the Printer's jobs
When start is executed
Then print is pending.
